1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,587
Merchants don’t know which missing details keep shopping agents from recommending their products.

2
00:00:05,537 --> 00:00:12,012
Agent Storefront Kit reveals those gaps and lets merchants preview fixes before changing their website.

3
00:00:12,072 --> 00:00:14,422
Start with a store URL.

4
00:00:14,422 --> 00:00:18,947
This is a real public storefront, not a fabricated product feed.

5
00:00:18,947 --> 00:00:22,635
The kit extracts products and checks eight signals.

6
00:00:22,635 --> 00:00:26,097
Sold-out items are recognized as unavailable.

7
00:00:26,097 --> 00:00:30,060
Missing information stays unknown instead of being invented.

8
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:33,510
For Shopify, connect the live catalog.

9
00:00:33,510 --> 00:00:40,410
The kit uses official Shop M C P to find products from this merchant, with current prices and availability.

10
00:00:40,410 --> 00:00:43,485
Product links stay exactly as returned.

11
00:00:43,485 --> 00:00:48,810
Warnings remain visible, and live products are not saved as reusable history.

12
00:00:48,810 --> 00:00:52,547
Next, review the suggested website fixes.

13
00:00:52,547 --> 00:00:56,697
Shipping and returns are prefilled from the website when we find them.

14
00:00:56,697 --> 00:01:02,172
Otherwise, the merchant gets an editable suggestion, clearly marked as a draft.

15
00:01:02,172 --> 00:01:07,147
Proposed changes stay separate from the original check until the merchant applies them.

16
00:01:07,147 --> 00:01:11,322
Ask for the best birthday gift under fifty dollars from this store.

17
00:01:11,322 --> 00:01:14,147
The store name changes with the URL.

18
00:01:14,147 --> 00:01:17,922
Preview the answer a customer would get from a shopping agent.

19
00:01:17,922 --> 00:01:21,822
The language model evaluates the actual product feed.

20
00:01:21,822 --> 00:01:26,847
The server checks its product choice, price, budget, and inventory.

21
00:01:26,847 --> 00:01:30,285
If nothing fits, it does not invent a match.

22
00:01:30,285 --> 00:01:33,860
Compare the current details with your proposed fixes.

23
00:01:33,860 --> 00:01:37,310
The system also works after the merchant steps away.

24
00:01:37,310 --> 00:01:44,610
A protected Vercel schedule searches the live catalog, evaluates the store, and saves a completed-check report.

25
00:01:44,610 --> 00:01:50,885
The monitoring screen shows when the work happened, what was checked, and which website fixes to review.

26
00:01:50,885 --> 00:01:56,785
Reports contain derived readiness information, not cached Shopify products or images.

27
00:01:56,785 --> 00:02:03,822
Discover real products, review missing details, steer the shopping agent, and monitor useful background work.

28
00:02:03,822 --> 00:02:12,285
Agent Storefront Kit runs on Vercel for the Agents and Factories track, with live Shop M C P commerce for the Shopify side quest.

